<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups Imperial Tobacco.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups Imperial Tobacco.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Tobacco Plc was raised to the &quot;recommended list&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was up 9p at 381 by 1102 GMT in active trade of 4.7 million shares.</p>
<p>Earlier Imperial shares touched a low of 350-1/2p, its lowest since its demerger from former conglomerate Hanson in October last year.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
